### Create a VIP ticket order with dynamic pricing
POST http://localhost:8080/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": 1,
  "categoryId": 4
}

### Test client-side price manipulation
POST http://localhost:8080/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": 1,
  "categoryId": 4,
  "finalAmount": 10
}

### Register a test user
POST http://localhost:8080/api/users/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "register_demo",
  "email": "register_demo@example.com",
  "password": "{{registerPassword}}"
}

### Login with the registered user
POST http://localhost:8080/api/users/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "register_demo",
  "password": "{{registerPassword}}"
}

### Login with a different password (expected to fail)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/users/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "register_demo",
  "password": "{{demoPassword}}"
}

### Get orders for user 1
GET http://localhost:8080/api/orders/user/1
